<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO-AFRICAN ZONE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO-AFRICAN ZONE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Davis Cup Euro-African</p>
<p>zone group three matches on Friday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Turkey beat San Marino 3-0</p>
<p>Baris Ergum beat Christian Rosti 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Erhan Oral beat Domenico Vicini 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Mustapha Azkara/Alaaddin Karagoz beat Gabriel Francini/Vicini</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Macedonia beat Ethiopia 2-1</p>
<p>Dragan Jovanovski lost to Samuel Gebriel 6-2 4-6 0-6</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko beat Yohanes Setegne 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Lazar Magdincev/Sevcenko beat Gebriel/Habtamu Kidane 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Senegal beat Bosnia-Herzegovia 3-0</p>
<p>Jean Noel Said beat Haris Basalic 7-6 6-3</p>
<p>Yahia Doumbia beat Merid Zahirovic 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Doumbia/Thierno Ly beat Basalic/Eldar Mustafic 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Luxembourg beat Armenia 3-0</p>
<p>Adria Graimprey beat Artak Harutyunyan 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Sacha Toma beat David Babayan 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Johnny Goudenbour/Pascal Schaul beat Harutyunyan/Anri Makichian</p>
<p>(Armenia) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Turkey and Macedonia level at 1-1.</p>
<p>Results (Turkish names first):</p>
<p>Alaaddin Karagoz (Turkey) beat Lazar Magdincev (Macedonia) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Baris Ergum lost to Zoran Sevcenko 4-6 0-6</p>
<p>San Marino lead Ethiopia 2-0</p>
<p>Results (San Marino names first):</p>
<p>Christian Rosti beat Habtamu Kidane 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Domenico Vicini beat Samuel Gebriel 6-2 6-4.</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Luxembourg and Senegal level at 1-1.</p>
<p>Results (Luxembourg names first):</p>
<p>Pascal Schaul beat Jean Noel Said 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Adria Graimprey lost to Yahiya Doumbia 7-5 4-6 2-6</p>
<p>Bosnia lead Armenia 2-0</p>
<p>Results (Bosnian names first):</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic beat Artak Harutyunyan 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic beat David Babayan 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>San Marino beat Ethiopia 2-1.</p>
<p>Doubles result (San Marino names first):</p>
<p>Gabriel Francini/Maximulano Rosti lost to Habtamu</p>
<p>Kidane/Yohannes Setegne 3-6 6-7.</p>
<p>Macedonia beat Turkey 2-1.</p>
<p>Doubles result (Turkish names first):</p>
<p>Erhan Oral/Mustapha Akara lost to Lazar Magdincev/Zoran Sevcenko 5-7 2-6.</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Senegal beat Luxemburg 2-1.</p>
<p>Doubles result (Luxembourg names first):</p>
<p>Johnny Goudenbour/Sacha Thomas lost to Yahiya Doumbia/Thierno Ly 6-7 2-6.</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Bosnia-Herzegovina beat Armenia 3-0.</p>
<p>Doubles result:</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic/Merid Zahirovic beat Haik Hakopian/Anri Makichian 6-4 6-2.</p>
</text>
